#53751
"Arena"
"This massive room with vaulted ceilings padded mats lining the floor has seen

many friendly battles between the brothers and their clan.  A placard with

names inscribed into it covers the eastern wall almost entirely.  Empty weapon

and armor racks litter the south side of the room.  The mats look well kept,

and aside from the scattered sweat and blood stains on them.

"
