#53752
"Bank and Storage Room"
"A more secluded and closed room, this room hosts a number of banded chests.

The ceiling is high and vaulted, which connects to the main room in the east.

The stone brick walls are covered with dark blue tapestries to warm the room.

The floors are paved with sandstone and quartz stones, cut precisely to form

the shape of three crossed swords.  The only exit is the one you came in, a

large steel door to the east.

"
"[Olah] DO NOT PURGE! -- STORAGE ROOM

"
