#53753
"Kitchen"
"A clean marble counter with assorted fruits and breads is the center of this

room, the fireplace roaring in on the west side of the room.  The brick work

around the hearth is of incredible craftsmanship, each brick seems to be lain

in its perfect place, in harmony with all the others.  The middle brick, in

the crest of the hearths opening has a small inscription of two axes,

presumably the trademark of a vain dwarven architect.  The scent of pepper and

stewed meats seems to fill the room with an enthralling aroma.  The walls have

hooks imbedded into them, for hanging meats, and the days catch.

"
""
