#53754
"Foyer"
"This immaculate room with its vaulted ceilings and clean steel crossbeams is

enormous.  The floors are tiled in what appear to be sandstone and quartz

squares, about the size of a foot.  Draped along the walls are banners

proclaiming the strength and fortitude of the Brotherhood.  To the north the

floor begins to show signs of wear, and you can hear the bustling sounds

escape the kitchen's confines.

"
