#53755
"Before a Fortress"
"The ground here has been cleared completely free of rocks and other debris.

Looming to the north is a grand fortress constructed from white granite.  A

large door made of shining steel guards the entrance.  Nothing conspicuous can

be detected along its imposing exterior.  To the east, travel becomes more

difficult as numerous rocks jut from the ground, making it appear as though

the fortress had magically arisen from below.

"
